    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Manase Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Manase ŋitomon ka ŋiarei ŋina esyakinia iŋes akipuka Yudaya. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋatomonikan ka ŋikan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosec Manase aneni ke Ekapolon, kiwuap ŋakiro ŋuna aronok nooi ŋuna sek etiyaete ŋituŋa ŋulu eritari Ekapolon anakwapin kec alokiŋaren Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Manase toduku nabo ŋakiboisyo nenimukur ŋuna koloŋ abwaŋabwaŋaari papa keŋ Esekia, ŋuna arae ŋakilipet ŋakujo ŋunagelae. Toduku iŋes ŋamuroeta ŋuna elipere Baal. Kitiyau iŋes etorube a akuj a ŋina anyaritae Asera, abu Manase kilip neni a ŋikacer ka abu kitiya aŋuna kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toduk iŋes ŋamuroeta ŋuna ilipere ŋakujo ŋunagelae tooma Akai ka Akuj neni koloŋ abala Ekapolon, “Yerusalem bon iŋes ekelipere ayoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toduku iŋes ŋamuroeta ŋuna elipere ŋikacer daadaŋ nalapatui ŋunaarei alo Kai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Manase kimasak nakim lokoku keŋ erae amuronot anakadipaalat a ŋina a Ben-Inom. Adwarenene iŋes, nabo torae ekekukujan, ekapilan ka eeki ŋililae. Tosec iŋes nooi neni ke Ekapolon, kitoŋo Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu kiwuak Kai ka Akuj etorube ŋolo ka akuj a ŋina anyaritae Asera, etorube ŋolo ecieuni iŋes, kiwuak Kai ŋin ŋina koloŋ alimokinit Ekapolon Daudi ka lokoku keŋ Solomon ebe, “Kai ka Akuj na ka ne Yerusalem, iŋes aseu ayoŋ anakwap a daadaŋ a ŋina a ŋikabilae a Ŋisirael atemar ekelipere ayoŋ ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyalemari nabo ayoŋ Ŋisirael anakwap a ŋina abu oinak atapapaa kec, erae ca kiwuapa Ŋisirael ŋuna daadaŋ abu ayoŋ ecik ikes, kiwuapa ŋakiciketa kaŋ daadaŋ, ŋikisila ka ŋuna atubunit ayoŋ atemar kiwuapa ikes alopite a ŋolo ecikitor Moses ikes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Manase kibata ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem akitiya aronis ŋina eloit nooi ŋina a ŋituŋa a ŋulu eritari Ekapolon anakwapin kec alokiŋaren Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kinyakunae Manase nakwap keŋ kedau akiki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon kirwor neni a Manase ka ŋituŋa keŋ, nai apotu ikes nyecamut ŋuna erworo Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Ekapolon yau ŋikapolok a ŋasigarya a erwosit ka Asiriya akirem ikes ka apotu torikosi Manase, kiwuakis ekodocet lokume keŋ, toena iŋes a ŋiriko a ŋulu etiyaunitae a eburonis, yaasi Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eyakaun Manase locan ŋul, abu kiwar ajokis ŋina a Ekapolon Akuj keŋ, kitiditeun bon nooi aneni ka Akuj atapapaa keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilip Manase neni ka Akuj, ido abu Akuj inak iŋes ŋuna ewarit, topupok adyekitoi keŋ, kinyaku iŋes Yerusalem ka napukan keŋ. Toyenu nai Manase atemar erae kire Ekapolon Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedaun ŋun, abu Manase toduk nabo nakadipaalat arwatata ŋina alokiŋa etaun a Daudi, ayai arwatata ŋin nakadipaalat To elelya Gion, toduk kitodol tari lopuke ŋolo anyaritae Epuke ŋolo a Ŋikolya, kisirimok arwatata emukura ŋolo enyaritae Opel; abu daŋ Manase kitooyaa arwatata nooi alokidiama. Kiwuanak ŋikapolok a ŋasigarya lotaunio a Yudaya daadaŋ ŋulu adukitoe ŋaduketa ŋunajiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolema alo Kai ka Akuj ŋakujo ŋunagelae ka tolema alo Kai ka Akuj etorube ŋolo ka akuj ŋolo sek kebu iŋes kiwuak nen, tolema tari ŋamuroeta daadaŋ ŋuna sek kebu iŋes toduk lomukura ŋolo ka Akai alo Yerusalem, tocaka ŋul daadaŋ kiŋa etaun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ iŋes todukok nabo Namuroet ŋina ke Ekapolon, inak a nen Akuj ŋamuronisya ŋuna a ekisil ka ŋainakineta ŋuna ka alakar neni ke Ekapolon. Tolimok ŋituŋa a Yudaya akitiyanakin Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋituŋa torubakis eyayeneneete ŋamuronisya nakiboisyo ŋunamukur, nai torae neni a Ekapolon Akuj kec bon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a Manase ŋuluce daadaŋ, akilip keŋ neni a Ekapolon ka ŋakiro a ŋiketeyenikinak a ŋulu apotu kirworo neni keŋ alokiro a Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro ŋuna ka akilip a Manase, epite ŋolo ainakinia Akuj Manase ŋuna ewarit Manase ka ŋuna a ŋakiboisyo a ŋuna abu iŋes toduk nenimukur, ido kiwuanak ŋitorubei a akuj a ŋina anyaritae Asera ka ŋitorubei ŋice daŋ eriŋa nyitiditeuna bon, igiritae lokitaaboi ŋulu igiritae ŋakiro a ŋiketeyenikinak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Manase totwan, tonukae kai ŋina ka apukan. Kilunyokin Amon ŋolo arae lokoku keŋ lokicoloŋ kipuka Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Amon Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru ka Amon ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiarei ŋina esyakinia akipuka. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes kitiya ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon lopite ŋolopei etiyator Manase ŋolo arae papa keŋ. Elipi Amon neni a ŋakujo a ŋun ka ayenene ŋamuronisya neni a ŋakujo a daadaŋ a ŋuna kebu Manase kitiyau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Amon nyitiditeun bon aneni ke Ekapolon ikwa papa keŋ, abu kitalala asecit keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikapolok ŋulu epukato ka Amon totuko, toara Amon alokai a ŋina ka apukan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya ŋuluce toara ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulusek aarete erwosit Amon, tosodo kituruwosi Yosia lokoku ka Amon erwosit kilunyokin lokicoloŋ a papa keŋ kipuka Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
